NAME: nicolae_pan_strange_glyph_angst
DEPTH: Pan
TAGS: unrand sub_strange_glyph allow_dup
SHUFFLE: AaBbCc/dd-D-E/-E-Ddd
SUBST: AC- = ., Bbd = x, ac = X, E = .D, D : .x, X = .x
MAP
xxxxx.X
ABC..x.
ABC...x
